flowchart TB
    CSV["DataCo CSVs<br/>Supply-chain records and web traffic"]
    ING["Python ingestion<br/>Column mapping and bulk loading"]
    AF["Airflow daily warehouse DAG<br/>Load → dbt build → dbt test → row checks"]
    CI["GitHub Actions<br/>dbt build and test on push / PR to main"]

    subgraph WH["Snowflake · existing warehouse"]
        RAW["RAW tables"]
        STG["Staging · 4 views<br/>Clean, cast and deduplicate"]
        MART["Marts · 4 tables<br/>fct_orders and dimensions<br/>One fact row per order item"]
        RPT["Reporting · 4 tables<br/>Delivery, revenue, historical risk, web traffic"]
        TESTS["86 dbt data-quality tests"]
        RAW --> STG --> MART --> RPT
        TESTS -. validates .-> STG
        TESTS -. validates .-> MART
        TESTS -. validates .-> RPT
    end

    CSV --> ING --> RAW
    AF -. orchestrates .-> ING
    AF -. orchestrates .-> STG
    CI -. builds and tests .-> STG

    subgraph ML["Recommended ML integration · separate training workflow"]
        FEAT["Shared feature preparation · ADD<br/>Available-at-prediction fields<br/>Numeric date features and schema checks"]
        SPLIT["Time-based train / validation / test · ADD<br/>Keep items of an order together"]
        SEL["SHAP feature selection · UPDATE<br/>Fit preprocessing and selector on training only"]
        SPEC["Selected features and fitted preprocessing<br/>Connect selection output to training"]
        TRAIN["XGBoost and LightGBM · UPDATE<br/>Train with selected features"]
        EVAL["Evaluation · UPDATE<br/>Select on validation ROC-AUC<br/>Final untouched test evaluation"]
        TRACK["MLflow tracking · EXISTS<br/>Parameters, metrics and models"]
        EXPLAIN["SHAP explanations · EXISTS"]
        PACKAGE["Versioned model bundle · ADD<br/>Model, preprocessing and feature schema"]
        FEAT --> SPLIT --> SEL --> SPEC --> TRAIN --> EVAL
        TRAIN --> TRACK
        EVAL --> EXPLAIN
        EVAL --> PACKAGE
    end

    MART --> FEAT

    subgraph PROD["Proposed production extension · not implemented"]
        OPEN["Live open orders<br/>New operational data source"]
        SCORE["Daily batch scoring<br/>After warehouse quality checks"]
        PRED["Snowflake risk predictions<br/>Order-item ID, score, timestamp, model version"]
        UI["Operations dashboard<br/>Prioritized orders for intervention"]
        MON["Monitoring<br/>Freshness, drift and delayed-label performance"]
        OPEN --> SCORE --> PRED --> UI
        PRED --> MON
    end

    FEAT -. reuse feature transformations .-> SCORE
    PACKAGE --> SCORE
    AF -. proposed scoring task .-> SCORE
    RPT -. proposed dashboard input .-> UI
    MON -. trigger validated retraining .-> FEAT

